    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5d666769a2401195f52dd4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……富士奇石俏皮地说着。\n她脸上挂着完美的笑容，\n令人看不清笑容之下隐藏的事物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4bf4cfeb4911ad172288dd5d6b078a2fc0720482d1a1e80107a6732a9ffb11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
