      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然她正在努力治疗与复健──\n但重回赛场的几率依然相当渺茫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ebd83334ca76422285a8366c371e36ac56b86ad5ae1f2035d82eaa22cfc0303",
