    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa8422b0dea459f125b23cfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "露出完美笑容的富士奇石真是位好演员。\n而所谓的演员“从不卸下演员身份”。\n自始至终坚持演出想展现给他人看见的一面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7a3cd555dbdf91faf85d70bfdbbda5351ba9fe0728e9fbe61f4a910735162a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
