      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此或许富士奇石已经下定决心\n不在美丽周日面前“展现”\n“现在的自己”了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "72289e27ef4b27b65b62969663a8d9692bd67bb03ac8e6f8a5c27db1096a89eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
